    "level": "ordinary",
    "year": null,
    "question": "The total surface area of a closed cylinder with radius $r$ and height $h$ is given by $A = 2\\pi r^2 + 2\\pi rh$.\nWrite the right-hand side as a product of $2\\pi r$ and a bracket.",
    "marks": 5,
    "steps": [
     {
      "title": "Find the highest common factor",
